class UnrealPostProcessVolume "UnrealPostProcessVolume" (
    doc = """A UE Post Process Volume (APostProcessVolume), rendered by hdUE: a box filling the cube from -1 to 1 of the prim's local space (a Cube prim's default extent), whose unreal:postProcess:<FPostProcessSettings property> attributes blend into the view by UE's own rules (priority, blend radius and weight, unbound) while the camera is inside or near it. The render settings' unreal:postProcess:* apply after the volumes, as a camera's do in UE."""
